 "description": "There are many words to describe DSCVR 9 Open, but ordinary is not one of them. This boat has the rebellious soul of bow riders – however, the way it feels and performs brings out traces of professional patrol boats and even speedboats. Out of all those day cruisers out there, this is truly the special one.\nThe DSCVR 9 Open takes you places in a style that enables enjoying the adventure the best possible way. While more than fully equipped for a relaxing day in the sun thanks to luxurious deck areas, it features all kinds of options for serious fun as well.\nThe stern area turns quickly into a bbq party space for up to ten people; DSCVR 9 Open is a great example of XO’s ability to use every square inch efficiently, in a multi-purpose way for the benefit of the customer.\nThe XO DSCVR 9 Open is the best choice for the boaters with active lifestyle, the ones who rejoice and relax by having fun and spending their days by feeling the sea around them.",
